<title>USA: Kansas feedlot cattle roundup - USDA.</title>
<headline>Kansas feedlot cattle roundup - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DODGE CITY 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said trade was rather slow late Thursday. Slaughter steers and heifers finished steady.</p>
<p>Inquiry was moderate, demand was fair. Sales confirmed on 2,100 slaughter steers and 1,300 slaughter heifers. For the week to date 115,700 head confirmed including 20,000 head or about 17 percent previously contracted or formulated cattle.</p>
<p>Steers - select and choice 2-3 1175-1335 lbs 64.00.</p>
<p>Heifers - select and choice 2-3 1050-1200 lbs 64.00.</p>
<p>confirmed: 3400	 last week: 2600     last year:  1900</p>
<p>week to date: 115700  last week: 62700    last year:  68100</p>
